Key Market Drivers
1. Growing Demand for Plant‑Based Beverages
The vegan coffee extract market is benefitting from a global shift toward plant‑based diets, with consumers seeking ethical and health‑focused alternatives to traditional coffee. Retail surveys show that over 45% of coffee drinkers are open to dairy‑free and vegan options, prompting manufacturers to expand their product portfolios.

2. Innovation in Extraction Technology
Advances in supercritical CO₂ and water‑based extraction methods have improved flavor fidelity and reduced solvent residues, making vegan coffee extracts more competitive with conventional concentrates. Companies that adopt these technologies report up to 30% higher yield efficiency.

